# The Bishop's fourth job node: a frontal channel bought out of a bank of holy
# lights rather than out of a cooldown.
#
# GMS prepares one light every 11 seconds, banks five, and spends one for every
# second the key is held -- so the skill answers the map rather than a clock.
# On a crowd the Bishop spends the light standing and goes back to Angel Ray;
# against a boss the lights pile up while they swing and go out together. A
# flat 55-second cooldown would state the same throughput and the wrong skill:
# it would lock the player out for five seconds at a time on a map, where the
# respawn beat is 7.56.
#
# `pulses_per_charge` is GMS's second of hold against its 240ms beat -- 4.17
# rounded to the pulse that fits inside it, so a full five-light dump is 20
# pulses rather than 21. The beat itself is `attackDelay 240`, published
# nowhere else; the community DPM calculator's key-down tick is 240 too, and
# its note that nine lights fire 41 ticks agrees to within a hundredth.
#
# `base_delay_ms` is the client's own wind-up and release -- `prepare/time 240`
# plus `keydownend/time 120` -- the floor a press is committed to. It never
# binds: one light already buys 960ms. masonym's 1320 is the LOOP action, not
# the floor.
#
# Dropped: the 40 MP an attack; the knockback and status immunity, neither of
# which anything here inflicts; and the frontal hitbox, nothing having a
# position. It does not retarget, which is faithful -- the light falls where
# the Bishop is standing.
name: "Divine Punishment"
description:
  "Punish the wicked in the name of Heaven. Spends the holy light you have "
  "prepared, one for every second you hold the key, and shelters you from "
  "half of what you take while it runs."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_HOLY
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BISHOP_V skill_order: 4 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
base_delay_ms: 360
cooldown_seconds: 1.5
max_enemies: 6
lines: 10
base { skill_pct: 3.38 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.13 }
channel {
  pulse_interval_ms: 240
  max_pulses: 20
  damage_taken_pct: 0.50
  charge_seconds: 11.0
  max_charges: 5
  pulses_per_charge: 4
}
